   "title": "VALCO returns to profitability with $1.4m positive EBITDA in first nine months of 2026",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/valco-returns-to-profitability-with-1-4m-positive-ebitda-in-first-nine-months-of-2026/",
