   "title": "Online shopping sales up 4.1% in Sept. on automobiles, food delivery services",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261102/online-shopping-sales-up-41-in-sept-on-automobiles-food-delivery-services",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Mon, 02 Nov 2026 05:57:02 GMT",
   "_dt": 1793599022.0,
   "ageDays": 1.39,
   "summary": "Korea rose 4.1 percent in September from a year earlier on stronger demand for automobiles and related products, government data showed Monday. The value of online shopping transactions came to 24.97 trillion won ($18.7 billion) in September, up 975.8 billion won from a year earlier, according to the Ministry of Data and Statistics.",
   "summary_zh": "政府数据周一显示，受汽车及相关产品需求增强带动，韩国9月经济同比上涨4.1%。据数据与统计部消息，9月网上购物交易额达到24.97万亿韩元（187亿美元），较上年同期增加9,758亿韩元。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Online shopping sales in Korea rose 4.1 percent in September from a year earlier on stronger demand for automobiles and related products, government data showed Monday. The value of online shopping transactions came to 24.97 trillion won ($18.7 billion) in September, up 975.8 billion won from a year earlier, according to the Ministry of Data and Statistics. The latest findings showed spending on automobiles and related products jumped 30.9 percent on-year to 1.27 trillion won. Money spent on food delivery services also moved up 4 percent to 3.78 trillion won, while spending on cosmetic products increased a sharp 12.2 percent to 1.29 trillion won. Purchases made through smartphones, tablets and other mobile devices rose 5.4 percent from a year earlier to 19.08 trillion won in September. They accounted for 76.4 percent of total sales, up 1 percentage point from a year earlier",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
