   "title": "Korea's Air Force to participate in US-led space war game for 1st time",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/defense/20261102/koreas-air-force-to-participate-in-us-led-space-war-game-for-1st-time",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
