   "title": "Seoul to launch emergency response system for Czech nuclear project",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/20261102/seoul-to-launch-emergency-response-system-for-czech-nuclear-project",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
