   "snippet": "🇳🇬🪖TROOPS REPEL T£RR⁰R!ST ATTACK ON SOKOTO–GUSAU ROAD! 🚨\n\nTroops of the Nigerian Army have k!11£d several b@nd!t tel£rr0r!sts and rescued a civilian after repelling an attack around Kuka Mairaho Village along the Sokoto–Gusau Main Supply Route.\n\nThe incident occurred at about 11:15 a.m. on November 1, 2026. Troops from FOBs Fangaltama and Gidan Kano mobilized after hearing gunshots and engaged the terrorists, forcing them to withdraw in disarray.\n\nOne civilian was rescued.\n\nTo our gallant troops well done. To the bandit t£rr0r!st no hiding place.",
   "body": "🇳🇬🪖TROOPS REPEL T£RR⁰R!ST ATTACK ON SOKOTO–GUSAU ROAD! 🚨\n\nTroops of the Nigerian Army have k!11£d several b@nd!t tel£rr0r!sts and rescued a civilian after repelling an attack around Kuka Mairaho Village along the Sokoto–Gusau Main Supply Route.\n\nThe incident occurred at about 11:15 a.m. on November 1, 2026. Troops from FOBs Fangaltama and Gidan Kano mobilized after hearing gunshots and engaged the terrorists, forcing them to withdraw in disarray.\n\nOne civilian was rescued.\n\nTo our gallant troops well done. To the bandit t£rr0r!st no hiding place.",
