   "title": "Well said, Admiral. Two details that strengthen your point. When he announced the end of the talks in June 2022, then-Foreign Secretary Locs",
   "url": "https://x.com/ShadowsOverPH/status/2117436655892382148",
   "snippet": "Well said, Admiral. Two details that strengthen your point. When he announced the end of the talks in June 2022, then-Foreign Secretary Locsin said the Philippines wanted those resources \"but not at the price of sovereignty; not even a particle of it.\" And former Justice Carpio said China tried to delete the Service Contract provisions stating that the oil and gas belong to the Philippines and that Philippine law governs, then walked away. The stakes are real: estimates for the Sampaguita gas field at Recto Bank range from 2.6 to as much as 4.6 trillion cubic feet, putting it in the same league as Malampaya. The Constitution isn't what's keeping that gas in the ground - it is 🇨🇳 - Stay strong 🇵🇭",
   "body": "Well said, Admiral. Two details that strengthen your point. When he announced the end of the talks in June 2022, then-Foreign Secretary Locsin said the Philippines wanted those resources \"but not at the price of sovereignty; not even a particle of it.\" And former Justice Carpio said China tried to delete the Service Contract provisions stating that the oil and gas belong to the Philippines and that Philippine law governs, then walked away. The stakes are real: estimates for the Sampaguita gas field at Recto Bank range from 2.6 to as much as 4.6 trillion cubic feet, putting it in the same league as Malampaya. The Constitution isn't what's keeping that gas in the ground - it is 🇨🇳 - Stay strong 🇵🇭",
