   "title": "EXPLAINED: CHINA’S ARUNACHAL POWER PLAY Fresh face-offs along the India-China border have brought Arunachal Pradesh into focus, raising conc",
   "url": "https://x.com/IndiaToday/status/2117141875350200345",
   "snippet": "EXPLAINED: CHINA’S ARUNACHAL POWER PLAY\n\nFresh face-offs along the India-China border have brought Arunachal Pradesh into focus, raising concerns over Beijing’s intentions along the Line of Actual Control (LAC).\n\nOn October 22, ITBP Director General Shatrujeet Kapur confirmed confrontations at multiple locations along the Arunachal border, with tensions centred around Asaphila in Upper Subansiri district.\n\nIs China pursuing a strategy of salami slicing—gradually testing Indian positions and pushing boundaries without triggering a full-scale conflict?\n\nWith China enjoying an infrastructure advantage in Tibet, India is accelerating border connectivity and surveillance to strengthen its defences.\n\nAre these isolated confrontations or part of a calculated strategy to keep India under pressure?\n\nRead more about Beijing’s Arunachal gambit in the latest issue of India Today Magazine.\nRead here: https://t.co/bY8bF5eHn1\n\n#IndiaChinaFaceOff #ArunachalPradesh #ITBP #Defence #IndiaTodayMagazine",
